 slow or not working because you have exceeded your plan’s monthly data limit of 15GB. You’ve used 15.1GB so far this cycle, which means your data connectivity is either cut off or severely slowed down.\n\nYou have two options to restore excellent internet speed:\n1. Refuel your data (add up to 2GB for $2.00 per GB).\n2. Change to a plan with a higher data limit.\n\nWould you like to refuel your data now? If so, how many GB (up to 2GB) would you like to add? Or would you like to hear about other plan options?","native_cost":0.0,"participant":"evaluated_agent","reasoning":null,"requestor":null,"role":"assistant","sequence":14,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T16:07:35.247097","tool_call_id":null,"tool_calls":[],"tool_error":null,"turn_index":14,"usage":{"completion_tokens":135,"prompt_tokens":7132}},{"content":"I definitely don’t want to change my plan, but I’m willing to refuel. Please add the full 2GB to my account so I can get back to excellent internet speed. What do I need to do next?","native_cost":0.0,"participant":"user_simulator","reasoning":null,"requestor":null,"role":"user","sequence":15,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T16:07:36.880339","tool_call_id":null,"tool_calls":[],"tool_error":null,"turn_index":15,"usage":{"completion_tokens":48,"prompt_tokens":2642}},{"content":null,"native_cost":0.0,"participant":"evaluated_agent","reasoning":null,"requestor":null,"role":"assistant","sequence":16,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T16:07:37.905257","tool_call_id":null,"tool_calls":[{"arguments":{"customer_id":"C1001","gb_amount":2,"line_id":"L1002"},"id":"call_8YJ1TTqjuKLDirMlb5bTVigM","name":"refuel_data","requestor":"evaluated_agent"}],"tool_error":null,"turn_index":16,"usage":{"completion_tokens":31,"prompt_tokens":7319}},{"content":"{\"message\": \"Successfully added 2 GB of data for line L1002 for $4.00\", \"new_data_refueling_gb\": \"2.0\", \"charge\": \"4.0\"}","native_cost":null,"participant":"tool_environment","reas