:21,"usage":{"completion_tokens":41,"prompt_tokens":2774}},{"content":"Let’s troubleshoot your mobile data connection step by step. I’ll guide you through some checks and fixes on your device to identify the issue.\n\nFirst, please check your phone’s status bar and let me know:\n- Do you see any signal bars?\n- Is there an icon for mobile data (like 4G, LTE, or 5G)?\n- Is Airplane Mode enabled?\n\nIf you’re not sure, I can walk you through how to check these. Let me know what you see, or if you’d like instructions for checking your status bar.","native_cost":0.0,"participant":"evaluated_agent","reasoning":null,"requestor":null,"role":"assistant","sequence":22,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T16:07:43.663175","tool_call_id":null,"tool_calls":[],"tool_error":null,"turn_index":22,"usage":{"completion_tokens":115,"prompt_tokens":7504}},{"content":null,"native_cost":0.0,"participant":"user_simulator","reasoning":null,"requestor":null,"role":"user","sequence":23,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T16:07:44.593105","tool_call_id":null,"tool_calls":[{"arguments":{},"id":"call_82f7ukTXTb8Dp4AWmJ6dZQ6V","name":"check_status_bar","requestor":"user_simulator"}],"tool_error":null,"turn_index":23,"usage":{"completion_tokens":12,"prompt_tokens":2934}},{"content":"Status Bar: 📶⁴ Excellent | 5G | 📵 Data Disabled | 🔒 VPN Connected | 🔋 80%","native_cost":null,"participant":"tool_environment","reasoning":null,"requestor":"user_simulator","role":"tool","sequence":24,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T16:07:44.593449","tool_call_id":"call_82f7ukTXTb8Dp4AWmJ6dZQ6V","tool_calls":[],"tool_error":false,"turn_index":24,"usage":null},{"content":"Here’s what I see on my status bar:\n- I have excellent signal bars.\n- There’s a 5G icon showing.\n- However, it looks like mobile data is disabled.\n- Airplane mode is not enabled.\n\nWhat should I do next to get my internet working?","native_cost":0.0,"participant":"user_simulator","reasoning":null,"requestor":null,"role":"user","sequence":25,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T16:07:45.827639","tool_call_id":null,"tool_calls":[],"tool_error":null,"turn_index":25,"usage":{"completion_tokens":59,"prompt_tokens":2980}},{"content":"Since your mobile data is currently disabled, please enable mobile data on your phone. This will allow your device to connect to the internet using your cellular network.\n\nOnce you’ve turned mobile data ON, try using the internet again and let me know if your connection is restored or if you still experience issues. If it’s still not working, I’ll guide you through the next troubleshooting steps.","native_cost":0.0,"participant":"evaluated_agent","reasoning":null,"requestor":null,"role":"assistant","sequence":26,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T16:07:47.169428","tool_call_id":null,"tool_calls":[],"tool_error":null,"turn_index":26,"usage":{"completion_tokens":79,"prompt_tokens":7682}},{"content":null,"native_cost":0.0,"participant":"user_simulator","reasoning":null,"requestor":null,"role":"user","sequence":27,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T16:07:48.256318","tool_call_id":null,"tool_calls":[{"arguments":{},"id":"call_RMZxhgZBpAM477QvCWNlCeuw","name":"toggle_data","requestor":"user_simulator"}],"tool_error":null,"turn_index":27,"usage":{"completion_tokens":11,"prompt_tokens":3122}},{"content":"Mobile Data is now ON.\nStatus Bar: 📶⁴ Excellent | 5G | 📱 Data Enabled | 🔒 VPN Connected | 🔋 80%","native_cost":null,"participant":"tool_environment","reasoning":null,"requestor":"user_simulator","role":"tool","sequence":28,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T16:07:48.256776","tool_call_id":"call_RMZxhgZBpAM477QvCWNlCeuw","tool_calls":[],"tool_error":false,"turn_index":28,"usage":null},{"content":null,"native_cost":0.0,"participant":"user_simulator","reasoning":null,"requestor":null,"role":"user","sequence":29,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T16:07:49.156458","tool_call_id":null,"tool_calls":[{"arguments":{},"id":"call_8OTOnqPoc0kVCBHzdiDY2Ch2","name":"run_speed_test","requestor":"user_simulator"}],"tool_error":null,"turn_index":29,"usage":{"completion_tokens":12,"prompt_tokens":3172}},{"content":"Speed test failed: No Connection.","native_cost":null,"participant":"tool_environment","reasoning":null,"requestor":"user_simulator","role":"tool","sequence":30,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T16:07:49.156776","tool_call_id":"call_8OTOnqPoc0kVCBHzdiDY2Ch2","tool_calls":[],"tool_error":false,"turn_index":30,"usage":null},{"content":"I turned mobile data on, but I still can’t connect to the internet—my speed test failed again with no connection. What should I try next?","native_cost":0.0,"participant":"user_simulator","reasoning":null,"requestor":null,"role":"user","sequence":31,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T16:07:50.190591","tool_call_id":null,"tool_calls":[],"tool_error":null,"turn_index":31,"usage":{"completion_tokens":33,"prompt_tokens":3197}},{"content":"Thank you for enabling mobile data. Since you still have no connection, let’s check if there are any restrictions or settings interfering with your data.\n\nPlease check if Data Saver mode is enabled on your phone. Data Saver can block or limit your mobile data connection.\n\nLet me know if Data Saver mode is ON. If you’re not sure how to check, I can provide instructions.","native_cost":0.0,"participant":"evaluated_agent","reasoning":null,"requestor":null,"role":"assistant","sequence":32,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T16:07:52.067144","tool_call_id":null,"tool_calls":[],"tool_error":null,"turn_index":32,"usage":{"completion_tokens":78,"prompt_tokens":7798}},{"content":null,"native_cost":0.0,"participant":"user_simulator","reasoning":null,"requestor":null,"role":"user","sequence":33,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T16:07:53.140853","tool_call_id":null,"tool_calls":[{"arguments":{},"id":"call_2GnSieYq1AbVZtfnNGuUKFC4","name":"check_data_restriction_status","requestor":"user_simulator"}],"tool_error":null,"turn_index":33,"usage":{"completion_tokens":15,"prompt_tokens":3312}},{"content":"Data Saver mode is OFF.","native_cost":null,"participant":"tool_environment","reasoning":null,"requestor":"user_simulator","role":"tool","sequence":34,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T16:07:53.141065","tool_call_id":"call_2GnSieYq1AbVZtfnNGuUKFC4","tool_calls":[],"tool_error":false,"turn_index":34,"usage":null},{"content":"Data Saver mode is currently off on my phone, so that’s not causing the issue. What should I check next?","native_cost":0.0,"participant":"user_simulator","reasoning":null,"requestor":null,"role":"user","sequence":35,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T16:07:54.311161","tool_call_id":null,"tool_calls":[],"tool_error":null,"turn_index":35,"usage":{"completion_tokens":26,"prompt_tokens":3342}},{"content":"Thank you for confirming that Data Saver mode is off. Next, let’s check if there are any issues with your SIM card, as SIM problems can prevent mobile data from working even if you have signal.\n\nPlease check your SIM card status on your phone. Look for any messages about the SIM being missing, locked, or inactive.\n\nLet me know what your SIM status says, or if you need instructions on how to check it.","native_cost":0.0,"participant":"evaluated_agent","reasoning":null,"requestor":null,"role":"assistant","sequence":36,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T16:07:55.666839","tool_call_id":null,"tool_calls":[],"tool_error":null,"turn_index":36,"usage":{"completion_tokens":88,"prompt_tokens":7906}},{"content":null,"native_cost":0.0,"participant":"user_simulator","reasoning":null,"requestor":null,"role":"user","sequence":37,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T16:07:56.605733","tool_call_id":null,"tool_calls":[{"arguments":{},"id":"call_helaio7jlr2xrCoF6QXYA33N","name":"check_sim_status","requestor":"user_simulator"}],"tool_error":null,"turn_index":37,"usage":{"completion_tokens":12,"prompt_tokens":3460}},{"content":"Your SIM card is active and working.","native_cost":null,"participant":"tool_environment","reasoning":null,"requestor":"user_simulator","role":"tool","sequence":38,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T16:07:56.606245","tool_call_id":"call_helaio7jlr2xrCoF6QXYA33N","tool_calls":[],"tool_error":false,"turn_index":38,"usage":null},{"content":"My SIM card status shows that it’s active and working properly. What should I try next to get my internet working?","native_cost":0.0,"participant":"user_simulator","reasoning":null,"requestor":null,"role":"user","sequence":39,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T16:07:57.860000","tool_call_id":null,"tool_calls":[],"tool_error":null,"turn_index":39,"usage":{"completion_tokens":26,"prompt_tokens":3486}},{"content":"Since your SIM card is active and working, the next step is to check your APN (Access Point Name) settings. Incorrect APN settings can prevent your phone from connecting to mobile data.\n\nPlease check your APN settings and let me know if anything looks incorrect or if the MMSC URL is missing. If you’re unsure how to check, I can guide you through the process. If the APN settings are incorrect or missing, I’ll instruct you on how to reset them.","native_cost":0.0,"participant":"evaluated_agent","reasoning":null,"requestor":null,"role":"assistant","sequence":40,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T16:08:00.998647","tool_call_id":null,"tool_calls":[],"tool_error":null,"turn_index":40,"usage":{"completion_tokens":100,"prompt_tokens":8024}},{"content":null,"native_cost":0.0,"participant":"user_simulator","reasoning":null,"requestor":null,"role":"user","sequence":41,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T16:08:02.273703","tool_call_id":null,"tool_calls":[{"arguments":{},"id":"call_RgFIzKr4Ix6pgDMV4J3vCiQQ","name":"check_apn_settings","requestor":"user_simulator"}],"tool_error":null,"turn_index":41,"usage":{"completion_tokens":13,"prompt_tokens